Dear Ms Smith,

Further to our telephone call, I attach a draft Defence in the claim brought =
by Dorothy Smith against Ann=D0=B0 =D0=92rown (Claim No. J7KW3671).

I can confirm that the court (County Court at Oxford) has listed the hearing =
