ented, although a few exhibits are still missing.

The draft is attached in Word format with tracked changes. Please send me you=
r comments by 26 September 2022, as the deadline for filing the response is f=
ixed by the court rules and cannot be extended without an application.

What we still need from you: confirmation of Dorothy Smith's address (149 Che=
stnut Grove, Stoke-on-Trent ST4 8NB), a copy of the payment slip for the depo=
sit to our client account, and scans of your correspondence for the last two =
years.

The deposit towards court fees of =C2=A31,568.00 should reach our account GB0=
2MONZ04685552312025 no later than the day before the hearing.

You can upload documents and photographs through our secure client portal: ht=
tps://kingsley.example.net/docs/20185. Please do not send documents containin=
g sensitive data by ordinary email.

Our witness, Richard Reyes, has been told that the court may require attendan=
ce; if his contact details (tel. 0116 496 0145) change, please let us know.

On strategy, I suggest we first seek the dismissal of the claim and, in the a=
